        {
          "line": 465,
          "text": "/// Whether a payload is a machine-wide notification (no `sessionId`) that must be **broadcast to every client**."
        },
        {
          "line": 466,
          "text": "/// These never fall through to the last-active-client fallback: `x.ai/sessions/changed`: the session roster changed; every open dashboard must stay in sync."
        },
        {
          "line": 467,
          "text": "/// Every connected client's model picker must refresh, not just the most recently active one. `x.ai/mcp/servers_updated`: the MCP catalog resolved or changed (managed connectors fetched in the background after `initialize`). The push fires seconds after `initialize` returns. Broadcast is safe: the pager handler only debounce-refetches `mcp/list` for agents with an open extensions modal."
        },
        {
          "line": 468,
          "text": "fn is_machine_wide_broadcast_notification(json: &serde_json::Value) -> bool {"
        },
        {
          "line": 469,
          "text": "    matches!("
        },
        {
          "line": 470,
          "text": "        method_of(json),"
        },
        {
          "line": 471,
          "text": "        Some("
        },
        {
          "line": 472,
          "text": "            \"x.ai/sessions/changed\""
        },
        {
          "line": 473,
          "text": "                | \"x.ai/models/update\""
        },
        {
          "line": 474,
          "text": "                | \"x.ai/mcp/servers_updated\""
        },
        {
          "line": 475,
          "text": "                | \"x.ai/announcements/update\""
        },
        {
          "line": 476,
          "text": "        )"
        },
        {
          "line": 477,
          "text": "    )"
        },
        {
          "line": 478,
          "text": "}"
        },
        {
          "line": 479,
          "text": "/// The namespaced method a leader payload carries, normalizing the two ext wire forms the gateway produces: direct: `{\"method\":\"x.ai/foo\", ...}` -> `x.ai/foo` wrapped: `{\"method\":\"_x.ai/foo\",\"params\":{\"method\":\"x.ai/foo\",...}}` -> `x.ai/foo`"
        }
